Our solution provides an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff's work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities. The tool may cover retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation; assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents; support in handling dossiers (admissions, coding, medico-social pathways, etc.); and support for the continuity of care between professionals, shifts, and services.

The solution must fit into existing practices of staff and not introduce a rupture in clinical or administrative workflows. Our proposed solution ensures this by providing an explainable and traceable AI system, allowing medical staff to understand the elements that led to an output. We will also provide change-management support and staff training to facilitate the adoption of our solution.

